{"type": "title", "paragraph_id": "H1_001", "section": "翰森制药集团有限公司 / 人才发展政策", "section_id": "SEC001", "page": 1, "pages": [1], "text": "一、目的", "block_type": "title", "source_parser": "docling", "source_block_id": "#/texts/0", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/0"], "bbox": [90.024, 157.43599999999992, 138.01999999999998, 169.51008695652172], "bboxes": [{"page": 1, "bbox": [90.024, 157.43599999999992, 138.01999999999998, 169.51008695652172], "source_block_id": "#/texts/0", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "mixed", "merge_method": "docling_semantic_title", "document_order": 1}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P1_001", "section": "翰森制药集团有限公司 / 人才发展政策", "section_id": "SEC001", "page": 1, "pages": [1], "text": "翰森制药集团有限公司(以下简称 ' 翰森制药 '' 公司 '' 我们 ' )为打造具有全球竞 争力的创新药人才高地,制定本人才发展政策,致力于让员工在达成个人职业成 就的同时,实现企业价值,推动企业创新与可持续发展。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "一、目的", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/1"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/1", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 1, "bbox": [90.02, 200.52, 505.41, 270.58], "source_block_id": "#/texts/1", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 200.52, 505.41, 270.58], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 2, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "title", "paragraph_id": "H1_002", "section": "翰森制药集团有限公司 / 人才发展政策", "section_id": "SEC001", "page": 1, "pages": [1], "text": "二、人才招募与规范用工", "block_type": "title", "source_parser": "docling", "source_block_id": "#/texts/2", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/2"], "bbox": [90.024, 301.4659999999999, 222.024, 313.5400869565217], "bboxes": [{"page": 1, "bbox": [90.024, 301.4659999999999, 222.024, 313.5400869565217], "source_block_id": "#/texts/2", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "mixed", "merge_method": "docling_semantic_title", "document_order": 3}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P1_002", "section": "翰森制药集团有限公司 / 人才发展政策", "section_id": "SEC001", "page": 1, "pages": [1], "text": "全球化人才布局:围绕重点疾病及技术领域,面向全球引进高层次人才。目前, 翰森制药已构建覆盖中国上海、连云港、常州及美国马里兰的全球化研发架构, 建立了不同民族、不同年龄、不同职业背景、不同性别的跨国人才梯队。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "二、人才招募与规范用工", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/3"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/3", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 1, "bbox": [90.02, 344.55, 510.02, 414.6], "source_block_id": "#/texts/3", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 344.55, 510.02, 414.6], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 4, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P1_003", "section": "翰森制药集团有限公司 / 人才发展政策", "section_id": "SEC001", "page": 1, "pages": [1], "text": "多元化引才渠道:通过校企合作、学术引进、行业招募等多渠道汇聚人才。深化 与高校、科研机构合作培养人才的模式,实现的精准育才。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "二、人才招募与规范用工", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/4"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/4", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 1, "bbox": [90.02, 439.37, 505.27, 480.48], "source_block_id": "#/texts/4", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 439.37, 505.27, 480.48], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 5, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P1_004", "section": "翰森制药集团有限公司 / 人才发展政策", "section_id": "SEC001", "page": 1, "pages": [1], "text": "多样化薪酬福利:提供行业中具备竞争力的薪酬待遇,并配套完善福利及保障体 系。 我们设置了管理程序, 保证为员工提供不低于当地最低工资标准的维生工资, 不提倡加班并提供加班费或调休,定期与工会开展磋商并签订集体协议,定期监 测男女薪酬差异确保同工同酬,依法提供带薪年假,并在法定福利基础上提供包 括补充商业保险,补充医疗保险,年度健康体检,以及例如食堂班车类工作生活 便利保障型福利等特色福利保障,同时实现惠及员工家庭的关怀体系。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "二、人才招募与规范用工", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/5"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/5", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 1, "bbox": [90.02, 505.13, 511.22, 662.31], "source_block_id": "#/texts/5", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 505.13, 511.22, 662.31], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 6, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
