{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P1_005", "section": "翰森制药集团有限公司 / 人才发展政策", "section_id": "SEC001", "page": 1, "pages": [1, 2, 3], "text": "翰森制药持续完善管理与技术双通道职业发展体系, 确保不同岗位的人才都能获得平等的职业发展机会。 导师制与知识传承:建立跨代际导师制度,由资深专家辅导青年人才,促进知识 经验传承。同时鼓励 ' 反向导师 ' ,让年轻人才向中高层管理者传授新技术、新理 念。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "三、双通道职业发展体系", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/7", "#/texts/10", "#/texts/26"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/7|#/texts/10|#/texts/26", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 1, "bbox": [90.02, 736.18, 505.34, 748.25], "source_block_id": "#/texts/7", "source_parser": "docling"}, {"page": 2, "bbox": [90.02, 85.56, 222.02, 97.63], "source_block_id": "#/texts/10", "source_parser": "docling"}, {"page": 3, "bbox": [90.02, 85.56, 505.37, 155.59], "source_block_id": "#/texts/26", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 736.18, 505.34, 748.25], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": true, "language": "zh", "document_order": 8, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
