{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P2_004", "section": "管理通道", "section_id": "SEC002", "page": 2, "pages": [2], "text": "路径设计: 基层技术或研究人员 → 高级技术或研究人员 → 技术骨干 → 技术专家 技术权威的专业晋升路径。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "技术通道", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/16"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/16", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 2, "bbox": [90.02, 306.39, 493.42, 347.38], "source_block_id": "#/texts/16", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 306.39, 493.42, 347.38], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 16, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P2_005", "section": "管理通道", "section_id": "SEC002", "page": 2, "pages": [2], "text": "能力要求:聚焦专业深度、技术创新能力与解决复杂技术问题能力。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "技术通道", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/18"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/18", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 2, "bbox": [90.02, 372.17, 450.02, 384.24], "source_block_id": "#/texts/18", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 372.17, 450.02, 384.24], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 17, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
