{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P2_008", "section": "管理通道", "section_id": "SEC002", "page": 2, "pages": [2], "text": "新员工融入计划:设计 ' 入职引导 + 导师带教 + 融入培训 ' 三位一体的入职体验,帮 助新员工快速适应组织文化和工作环境。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "四、分层分类培养体系", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/22"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/22", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 2, "bbox": [90.02, 560.84, 505.39, 601.83], "source_block_id": "#/texts/22", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 560.84, 505.39, 601.83], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 21, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P2_009", "section": "管理通道", "section_id": "SEC002", "page": 2, "pages": [2], "text": "领导力发展计划:针对高潜质管理人员,实施领导力培养计划,通过战略项目实 践、外部交流等方式,培养未来领军人物。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "四、分层分类培养体系", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/23"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/23", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 2, "bbox": [90.02, 626.6, 505.34, 667.71], "source_block_id": "#/texts/23", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 626.6, 505.34, 667.71], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 22, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P2_010", "section": "管理通道", "section_id": "SEC002", "page": 2, "pages": [2], "text": "专业技术提升计划:依托 ' 学习强森 ' 线上学习平台,搭配线下各类分享、培训、 考核,形成多维度、全覆盖的差异化专业技术培训体系。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "四、分层分类培养体系", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/24", "#/texts/25"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/24|#/texts/25", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 2, "bbox": [90.02, 692.38, 508.74, 704.45], "source_block_id": "#/texts/24", "source_parser": "docling"}, {"page": 2, "bbox": [90.02, 721.42, 390.07, 733.49], "source_block_id": "#/texts/25", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 692.38, 508.74, 704.45], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 23, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P3_001", "section": "管理通道", "section_id": "SEC002", "page": 3, "pages": [3], "text": "ESG 知识系统搭建:面向全体员工,我们设置了年度必修 ESG 培训,包含气候 环境与生态、多元化、质量意识、可持续供应链、信息安全、药物警戒、知识产 权、上市合规以及商业行为与道德准则等多门课程。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": null, "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/27"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/27", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 3, "bbox": [90.02, 180.36, 505.42, 250.42], "source_block_id": "#/texts/27", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 180.36, 505.42, 250.42], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 24, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "title", "paragraph_id": "H3_001", "section": "管理通道", "section_id": "SEC002", "page": 3, "pages": [3], "text": "五、终身学习机制", "block_type": "title", "source_parser": "docling", "source_block_id": "#/texts/28", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/28"], "bbox": [90.024, 281.3059999999999, 186.024, 293.3800869565217], "bboxes": [{"page": 3, "bbox": [90.024, 281.3059999999999, 186.024, 293.3800869565217], "source_block_id": "#/texts/28", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "mixed", "merge_method": "docling_semantic_title", "document_order": 25}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P3_002", "section": "管理通道", "section_id": "SEC002", "page": 3, "pages": [3], "text": "个性化学习账户:为员工配置学习发展资源,支持员工参与外部培训、行业会议 和学历教育。对符合条件的通过职业资格考试、提升学历的职工,提供不同形式 和程度的支持。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "五、终身学习机制", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/29"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/29", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 3, "bbox": [90.02, 324.39, 505.39, 394.44], "source_block_id": "#/texts/29", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 324.39, 505.39, 394.44], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 26, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P3_003", "section": "管理通道", "section_id": "SEC002", "page": 3, "pages": [3], "text": "知识管理系统:建立内部知识库和案例库,推动隐形知识显性化。定期举办 ' 技 术沙龙 '' 能力竞赛 ' 和 ' 创新论坛 ' ,促进跨部门知识共享与协作创新。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "五、终身学习机制", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/30"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/30", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 3, "bbox": [90.02, 419.21, 505.32, 460.2], "source_block_id": "#/texts/30", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 419.21, 505.32, 460.2], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 27, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P3_004", "section": "管理通道", "section_id": "SEC002", "page": 3, "pages": [3], "text": "学习型组织建设:通过阅读分享活动、技能兴趣社等多元化形式,营造持续学习 氛围。 在各运营基地建设职场疗愈空间和图书角, 为员工自我提升提供良好环境。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "五、终身学习机制", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/31"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/31", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 3, "bbox": [90.02, 484.97, 511.22, 526.08], "source_block_id": "#/texts/31", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 484.97, 511.22, 526.08], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 28, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
