{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P3_005", "section": "管理通道", "section_id": "SEC002", "page": 3, "pages": [3], "text": "动态薪酬体系:构建基本工资、绩效薪酬、定向激励相结合的薪酬结构,突出绩 效导向,让薪酬与岗位价值、工作业绩、个人能力紧密挂钩。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "六、多元化激励机制", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/33"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/33", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 3, "bbox": [90.02, 599.96, 505.22, 641.07], "source_block_id": "#/texts/33", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 599.96, 505.22, 641.07], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 30, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P3_006", "section": "管理通道", "section_id": "SEC002", "page": 3, "pages": [3], "text": "创新激励计划:对优质创新项目给予资源倾斜,定期奖励和表彰重大突破团队和 个人。为科研技术人员设置关键技术成果或工艺优化评优机制,激发创新活力。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "六、多元化激励机制", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/34"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/34", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 3, "bbox": [90.02, 665.84, 510.02, 706.85], "source_block_id": "#/texts/34", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 665.84, 510.02, 706.85], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 31, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P3_007", "section": "管理通道", "section_id": "SEC002", "page": 3, "pages": [3], "text": "长期激励措施:设置包括股权激励在内中长期激励方式,使员工利益与企业长远", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "六、多元化激励机制", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/35"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/35", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 3, "bbox": [90.02, 731.62, 505.22, 743.69], "source_block_id": "#/texts/35", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 731.62, 505.22, 743.69], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 32, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
