{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P4_002", "section": "发展紧密相连。", "section_id": "SEC003", "page": 4, "pages": [4], "text": "高层支持: 在董事会层面设置薪酬委员会和提名委员会, 审慎决策高层人才任免; 在执行层面成立组织与人才发展工作组,确保人才政策与企业战略同步推进。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "七、组织保障与评估机制", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/39"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/39", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 4, "bbox": [90.02, 237.39, 511.22, 278.38], "source_block_id": "#/texts/39", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 237.39, 511.22, 278.38], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 36, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P4_003", "section": "发展紧密相连。", "section_id": "SEC003", "page": 4, "pages": [4], "text": "评估反馈:建立人才发展指标体系,定期跟踪双通道晋升比例、关键人才保留率、 员工敬业满意度等核心数据,全面评估用人机制的合理性和有效性,及时发现并 规避风险。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "七、组织保障与评估机制", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/40"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/40", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 4, "bbox": [90.02, 303.15, 511.22, 373.18], "source_block_id": "#/texts/40", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 303.15, 511.22, 373.18], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 37, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P4_004", "section": "发展紧密相连。", "section_id": "SEC003", "page": 4, "pages": [4], "text": "持续优化:每年进行人才政策复盘,根据内外部环境变化和业务需求,及时调整 和完善人才培养与发展策略。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "七、组织保障与评估机制", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/41"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/41", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 4, "bbox": [90.02, 397.97, 505.37, 439.08], "source_block_id": "#/texts/41", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 397.97, 505.37, 439.08], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 38, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "title", "paragraph_id": "H4_003", "section": "发展紧密相连。", "section_id": "SEC003", "page": 4, "pages": [4], "text": "八、批准与生效", "block_type": "title", "source_parser": "docling", "source_block_id": "#/texts/42", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/42"], "bbox": [90.024, 469.966, 174.024, 482.0400869565217], "bboxes": [{"page": 4, "bbox": [90.024, 469.966, 174.024, 482.0400869565217], "source_block_id": "#/texts/42", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "mixed", "merge_method": "docling_semantic_title", "document_order": 39}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P4_005", "section": "发展紧密相连。", "section_id": "SEC003", "page": 4, "pages": [4], "text": "本政策旨在为翰森制药的长期可持续发展提供坚实人才保障, 通过双通道职业发 展体系实现人才多元化成长,通过终身学习机制激发组织创新活力,最终形成人 才与企业共同成长的良性生态。翰森制药将以此政策为指导,持续打造业内领先 的雇主品牌,为 ' 致力于成为全球领先的创新驱动型制药企业 ' 的愿景提供强而 有力的人才支撑。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "八、批准与生效", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/43"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/43", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 4, "bbox": [90.02, 512.93, 505.42, 641.07], "source_block_id": "#/texts/43", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 512.93, 505.42, 641.07], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 40, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P4_006", "section": "发展紧密相连。", "section_id": "SEC003", "page": 4, "pages": [4], "text": "本政策经翰森制药董事会审批后发布,并自发布之日起生效。翰森制药拥有对本 文件的解释权及修订权。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "八、批准与生效", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/44"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/44", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 4, "bbox": [90.02, 665.84, 505.22, 706.85], "source_block_id": "#/texts/44", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [90.02, 665.84, 505.22, 706.85], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 41, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
